  "description": "YITAMOTOR floor mats completely line the interior carpet to provide all-encompassing protection. We are confident that our products will surpass your expectations and make you a happy customer!\nFitment\n2017-2026 Honda Ridgeline Crew Cab\nOnly fit carpet floor, not fit vehicles with vinyl flooring.\nFor your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFeatures\nCompatibility: Custom fit for Honda Ridgeline 2026 2025 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 2019 2018 2017 Crew Cab. 3D laser scanning tech gives the 1st, 2nd & 2nd row cargo floor edge to edge protection, including the areas under the accelerator and brake pedals, the edges of the seat slide rails.\nSturdy & Non-slip: Made from odorless high-density thickened TPE rubber, these specifically tailored Honda Ridgeline floor liners are of great touch feeling and extreme wear-resistance. These mats for Ridgeline crew cab contain no latex, cadmium, lead, or harmful PVC, and the non-slip design makes them stay in place firmly for safe driving experience.\nAll Weather Protection: Our floor mats come with anti-slip retainer clips, and textured surface that help keep the liners from shifting, flexible even in harsh cold or hot weather. The raised edge and deep ribs of the mat can effectively trap liquids, debris, snow, mud, sand, and other elements to render full protection all year around.\nEasy Maintenance: Installation & cleaning for these Honda Ridgeline Crew Cab accessories is a breeze. Simply remove the old mats, then place and snug our new floor liners. Shake off or hose down the mess to achieve a pristine look after long time use, no need for vacuuming or harsh chemicals. The maintenance are easy to be done in minutes.\nWhy Choose Us: YITAMOTOR floor mats are engineered with advanced technology for tailored protection; The dedicated US-based teams deliver the floor liners of all-weather guard and built-to-last quality.",
